### IV. JAVASCRIPT & STYLESHEET SCOPE MAPPING\
\
1. JAVASCRIPT ASSET MANAGEMENT (`assets/js/`):\
   - All client-side JavaScript must reside in external `.js` files within `assets/js/`. Embedded `<script>` blocks inside PHP templates are strictly prohibited.\
   - JS must NEVER manipulate inline styles via `element.style.cssText` or `element.setAttribute('style', ...)`. Driven strictly by toggling CSS classes (`.classList.add()`, `.remove()`). Exception: Dynamic progress bar widths (`fill.style.width = X%`).\
\
2. STYLESHEET SCOPE MAP (`assets/css/`):\
   - All visual styling must reside in external stylesheets: `sywat-buttons.css`, `sywat-core.css`, `sywat-modals.css`, `sywat-public.css`, `sywat-tables.css`, `sywat-toolbar.css`.\
